\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.1, immediately after Definition 1.29"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"227334a8639e2b87\" href=\"?note=227334a8639e2b87\" title=\"27-df-boolderivative\">27-df-boolderivative</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888932bbbe1a9581\" href=\"?note=888932bbbe1a9581\" title=\"27-df-essvar\">27-df-essvar</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"888932bbbe1a9581\" href=\"?note=888932bbbe1a9581\" title=\"27-df-essvar\">27-df-essvar</a> 中的本质坐标集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\partial_i f\\ne\\mathbf0_{n-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\in\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\partial_i f\\ne\\mathbf0_{n-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个 cofactor 在某点不同当且仅当其异或在某点为 1；这正是 Ess 的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypo